@@ Test 3: Loop algorithm - For-To-Next (Basic style)
#Program LOOP;
Start Variable I, SUM, N, FACT

@@ Sum of numbers from 1 to N
Get(N);
SUM >> 0;

For I >> 1 To N
    SUM >> SUM + I;
Next I;

Put(SUM);

@@ Factorial calculation
Get(N);
FACT >> 1;

For I >> 1 To N
    FACT >> FACT Mul I;
Next I;

Put(FACT);

@@ Countdown using labels and goto
I >> 5;

LOOP:
Put(I);
I >> I - 1;
If I !< 1 Then Goto LOOP;

Stop
